  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">介紹：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">這個模組透過改善現有結構來強化《Minecraft》中的村莊，讓它們感覺更生動且探索起來更有趣。<br><br>「更好的村莊」改善了村莊的整體外觀和佈局，新增了房屋的設計樣式。本模組旨在為玩家創造更沉浸且真實的體驗。<br><br>對於喜歡在《Minecraft》中探索和與村莊互動的玩家來說，「更好的村莊」是個很棒的模組，它為那些想在遊戲中增添變化的玩家提供了新的遊戲選項和挑戰。如果你想提升《Minecraft》的遊戲體驗，「更好的村莊」絕對值得一試！</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gSdaxuLQ0Fw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相容性：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組設計上確保最大相容性。然而，部分模組可能需要專屬的相容性套件才能達到完美效果。整體而言，它應能與大多數模組配合使用，當然也可能存在少數未預見的問題或錯誤。</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">完美相容於：</p><ul>\n<li>Repurposed Structures</li>\n<li>ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village</li>\n<li>Bountiful（資料包可於 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a>）</li>\n<li>Ice and Fire: Dragons（資料包可於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-ice-and-fire-compat-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a>）</li>\n<li>More Villagers（資料包可於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-more-villagers-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a>）</li>\n<li>Immersive Engineering（資料包可於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a>）</li>\n<li>Waystones</li>\n<li>以及其他...</li>\n</ul><p>注意：其他相容性項目正在規劃中，我們正積極開發。歡迎到我們的 GitHub 提交相容性請求（或加入我們的 Discord！）。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模組載入器，版本涵蓋從 1.16.5 到最新的《Minecraft》發行版。請瀏覽以下連結選擇你偏好的模組載入器：</p><div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/forge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，它們是專案正常運作並提供完整體驗的關鍵。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">連結：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">尋找我們的資源並加入社群：</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 連結樹 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案自豪地由 BisectHosting 支援。查看他們的服務，輕鬆以高品質和可靠性託管你的專案。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有疑問嗎？需要協助？加入我們的 Discord 或造訪 GitHub，與社群互動並貢獻心力！</p>",
